Subject: [PATCH net 08/15] ice: E825: clear PHY_REG_TX_MEMORY_STATUS prior to soft reset
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 17:34:17 -0700
Message-ID: <20260911003430.3386340-9-anthony.l.nguyen@intel.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.47.1
In-Reply-To: <20260911003430.3386340-1-anthony.l.nguyen@intel.com>
References: <20260911003430.3386340-1-anthony.l.nguyen@intel.com>
Precedence: bulk
X-Mailing-List: netdev@vger.kernel.org
List-Id: <netdev.vger.kernel.org>
List-Subscribe: <mailto:netdev+subscribe@vger.kernel.org>
List-Unsubscribe: <mailto:netdev+unsubscribe@vger.kernel.org>
